PDF's can be dangerous

Many internet users think pdf's can't be dangerous but it can absolutely be.

PDF's can contain all kind of things, like images, videos, malicious javascript.

If internet users would take a look at pdf's in their computers using properties they can see that it's an SCR application which looks like a pdf.

And if the pdf is really big in size like 700 mb the file might be probably filled with empty code so that it's too large to go through virus scanning software.

This is why downloading random files is dangerous.
